 "lines": [
  {
   "i": 0,
   "start": 11.14,
   "end": 17.16,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Goku",
   "text": "♪ 'You put the lime in the coconut and drink 'em both up' ♪"
  },
  {
   "i": 1,
   "start": 17.16,
   "end": 18.4,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "King Kai",
   "text": "Goku, come in! *says Chi Chi*"
  },
  {
   "i": 2,
   "start": 18.4,
   "end": 19.64,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Goku",
   "text": "Oh hey, King Kai!"
  },
  {
   "i": 3,
   "start": 19.64,
   "end": 23.26,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "King Kai",
   "text": "Your friends are in trouble, Goku! Are you healed yet?"
  },
  {
   "i": 4,
   "start": 23.26,
   "end": 25.92,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Goku",
   "text": "Uhh... nah, I don't think so."
  },
  {
   "i": 5,
   "start": 25.92,
   "end": 28.0,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "King Kai",
   "text": "Well, how long do you think it's gonna take?"
  },
  {
   "i": 6,
   "start": 28.0,
   "end": 30.78,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Goku",
   "text": "Well, I think the machine will tell me when I'm done."
  },
  {
   "i": 7,
   "start": 30.78,
   "end": 33.72,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "King Kai",
   "text": "OK... you *think*, or you *know*?"
  },
  {
   "i": 8,
   "start": 35.2,
   "end": 37.08,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Goku",
   "text": "♪ ...You put the lime in the coconut-- ♪"
  },
  {
   "i": 9,
   "start": 37.08,
   "end": 37.74,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "King Kai",
   "text": "GOKU!"
  },
  {
   "i": 10,
   "start": 37.74,
   "end": 43.1,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Goku",
   "text": "Aww c'mon, King Kai, they don't need my help. I bet they're doing just fine on their own."
  },
  {
   "i": 11,
   "start": 43.1,
   "end": 44.02,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "Healer's down!"
  },
  {
   "i": 12,
   "start": 44.02,
   "end": 44.66,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Krillin",
   "text": "Need a res!"
  },
  {
   "i": 13,
   "start": 44.66,
   "end": 45.6,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Gohan",
   "text": "Out of mana!"
  },
  {
   "i": 14,
   "start": 45.6,
   "end": 48.9,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "WAAAAAAAGH...!"
  },
  {
   "i": 15,
   "start": 46.4,
   "end": 48.9,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Krillin",
   "text": "WAAAAAAAH...!"
  },
  {
   "i": 16,
   "start": 47.18,
   "end": 48.9,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Gohan",
   "text": "AAAAAAAH...!"
  },
  {
   "i": 17,
   "start": 48.1,
   "end": 48.9,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Freeza",
   "text": ">:)<"
  },
  {
   "i": 18,
   "start": 69.88,
   "end": 71.62,
   "kind": "direction",
   "speaker": null,
   "text": "Dramatic sting"
  },
  {
   "i": 19,
   "start": 71.62,
   "end": 72.3,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Piccolo",
   "text": "(Growling)"
  },
  {
   "i": 20,
   "start": 72.3,
   "end": 78.18,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Freeza",
   "text": "It's been so long since I've had to use this form. It feels like an old suit I never have an occasion to wear."
  },
  {
   "i": 21,
   "start": 78.62,
   "end": 79.34,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Piccolo",
   "text": "Ugh!"
  },
  {
   "i": 22,
   "start": 78.62,
   "end": 79.34,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Krillin",
   "text": "Ugh!"
  },
  {
   "i": 23,
   "start": 80.68,
   "end": 85.18,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Freeza",
   "text": "Unfortunately, whenever I put it on... someone *dies*."
  },
  {
   "i": 24,
   "start": 85.44,
   "end": 87.24,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Gohan",
   "text": "Dende... *no*!"
  },
  {
   "i": 25,
   "start": 87.24,
   "end": 93.02,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Freeza",
   "text": "Oh, don't cry for the poor thing. I've saved him the fate of seeing what I'm about to do to you."
  },
  {
   "i": 26,
   "start": 93.02,
   "end": 95.2,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "Joke's on you; he hated the bald one."
  },
  {
   "i": 27,
   "start": 95.2,
   "end": 96.82,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Krillin",
   "text": "Hey, that's not fair!"
  },
  {
   "i": 28,
   "start": 96.82,
   "end": 98.34,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Krillin",
   "text": "He just met Piccolo!"
  },
  {
   "i": 29,
   "start": 98.34,
   "end": 100.34,
   "kind": "direction",
   "speaker": null,
   "text": "Dramatic music"
  },
  {
   "i": 30,
   "start": 102.22,
   "end": 103.06,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "GET DOWN!"
  },
  {
   "i": 31,
   "start": 105.48,
   "end": 108.02,
   "kind": "sfx",
   "speaker": null,
   "text": "BOOOM"
  },
  {
   "i": 32,
   "start": 105.48,
   "end": 108.02,
   "kind": "direction",
   "speaker": null,
   "text": "Dramatic sting"
  },
  {
   "i": 33,
   "start": 108.38,
   "end": 111.66,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Krillin",
   "text": "I couldn't even follow that attack! It was almost instantaneous!"
  },
  {
   "i": 34,
   "start": 111.66,
   "end": 115.34,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "Yep! Just gonna stand here and keep being awesome."
  },
  {
   "i": 35,
   "start": 115.34,
   "end": 117.82,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Piccolo",
   "text": "There's nothing we can do against that kind of power!"
  },
  {
   "i": 36,
   "start": 117.82,
   "end": 120.78,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "Uhh, hello? Awesome. Right here."
  },
  {
   "i": 37,
   "start": 120.78,
   "end": 122.28,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Gohan",
   "text": "We're all gonna die!"
  },
  {
   "i": 38,
   "start": 122.98,
   "end": 129.16,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "You know what? All of you better duck, because I'm about to turn left, and I don't wanna smack you with my dick."
  },
  {
   "i": 39,
   "start": 129.34,
   "end": 133.22,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Freeza",
   "text": "Oh look at you, Vegeta. You're really going to fight me."
  },
  {
   "i": 40,
   "start": 133.22,
   "end": 136.92,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Freeza",
   "text": "Well, n-not really fight, more like... flailing angrily..."
  },
  {
   "i": 41,
   "start": 136.92,
   "end": 144.68,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "Make your jokes while you can, Freeza, because I can now see the peak of your power... while I'm only beginning to tap into mine."
  },
  {
   "i": 42,
   "start": 144.68,
   "end": 146.64,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Freeza",
   "text": "I feel like we've been here before. Have we been here before?"
  },
  {
   "i": 43,
   "start": 146.64,
   "end": 149.86,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "You see, I have finally realized the legend!"
  },
  {
   "i": 44,
   "start": 149.86,
   "end": 151.92,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Freeza",
   "text": "Oh my God, this *is* happening again!"
  },
  {
   "i": 45,
   "start": 151.92,
   "end": 157.1,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "That's right. You're not dealing with the average Saiyan warrior anymore, Freeza."
  },
  {
   "i": 46,
   "start": 157.4,
   "end": 163.72,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "I, Vegeta, have finally become: THE LEGENDARY SUPER SAIYAN™!"
  },
  {
   "i": 47,
   "start": 163.72,
   "end": 164.58,
   "kind": "direction",
   "speaker": null,
   "text": "Dramatic sting"
  },
  {
   "i": 48,
   "start": 165.68,
   "end": 179.48,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Freeza",
   "text": "OK, seriously, first off - \"Super Saiyan\"... what *is* that? What even *is* that? I'll tell you what it is: It's just some *stupid* legend passed by your filthy monkey ancestors around a campfire like it was their own dung!"
  },
  {
   "i": 49,
   "start": 179.82,
   "end": 185.3,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Freeza",
   "text": "Let me tell you, Vegeta: I don't deal in *legends*; I deal in facts."
  },
  {
   "i": 50,
   "start": 185.48,
   "end": 193.64,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Freeza",
   "text": "And here's a fact: By the end of this, you are going to be crying... like a little... *bitch*."
  },
  {
   "i": 51,
   "start": 195.42,
   "end": 197.68,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "...Bitch, you just jealous of my Super Saiyan Swagger!"
  },
  {
   "i": 52,
   "start": 197.68,
   "end": 198.78,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Freeza",
   "text": "Oh, for f**k's sake..."
  },
  {
   "i": 53,
   "start": 198.78,
   "end": 200.36,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "HAARRRWAAUGH!"
  },
  {
   "i": 54,
   "start": 200.56,
   "end": 201.06,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "HYAHH!"
  },
  {
   "i": 55,
   "start": 201.88,
   "end": 203.88,
   "kind": "direction",
   "speaker": null,
   "text": "Vegeta continues to grunt while he attacks Freeza"
  },
  {
   "i": 56,
   "start": 206.38,
   "end": 210.36,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "'Yes! I have him on the ropes! All he can do is dodge me!'"
  },
  {
   "i": 57,
   "start": 210.86,
   "end": 216.82,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Freeza",
   "text": "'God - Zarbon's dead, Dodoria's dead, the Ginyu's are dead... this has been one giant mess.'"
  },
  {
   "i": 58,
   "start": 216.82,
   "end": 220.88,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Freeza",
   "text": "'It's just like that jockstrap incident; only now, I don't have Ginyu around to dig the holes.'"
  },
  {
   "i": 59,
   "start": 220.88,
   "end": 222.38,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "AAAARRRRGH!"
  },
  {
   "i": 60,
   "start": 222.62,
   "end": 223.68,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "Huh? Wha--?"
  },
  {
   "i": 61,
   "start": 223.68,
   "end": 227.66,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Freeza",
   "text": "This may be a little off topic, but how good are you at digging holes?"
  },
  {
   "i": 62,
   "start": 224.92,
   "end": 225.42,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "Ugh!"
  },
  {
   "i": 63,
   "start": 227.66,
   "end": 228.16,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "What are--"
  },
  {
   "i": 64,
   "start": 228.16,
   "end": 230.88,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Freeza",
   "text": "I mean, besides the one you've already dug yourself into."
  },
  {
   "i": 65,
   "start": 231.2,
   "end": 233.52,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "Hurrgh, don't you MOCK ME!!"
  },
  {
   "i": 66,
   "start": 233.86,
   "end": 234.46,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Freeza",
   "text": "Oh?"
  },
  {
   "i": 67,
   "start": 235.66,
   "end": 236.88,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "HRAAAAGH!"
  },
  {
   "i": 68,
   "start": 239.1,
   "end": 240.7,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "HRAGH! HRAGH! HRAGH! HRAGH!"
  },
  {
   "i": 69,
   "start": 245.66,
   "end": 247.96,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Krillin",
   "text": "I don't get it! Why can't Vegeta hit him?!"
  },
  {
   "i": 70,
   "start": 247.96,
   "end": 249.44,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "DAKKA! DAKKA! DAKKA!"
  },
  {
   "i": 71,
   "start": 247.96,
   "end": 251.82,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Piccolo",
   "text": "Because he keeps aiming where he is instead of where he's going to be!"
  },
  {
   "i": 72,
   "start": 252.84,
   "end": 253.36,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Gohan",
   "text": "Uuugh!"
  },
  {
   "i": 73,
   "start": 253.68,
   "end": 254.68,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Piccolo",
   "text": "'Oh, crap (!)'"
  },
  {
   "i": 74,
   "start": 254.68,
   "end": 255.88,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Krillin",
   "text": "So, does this mean we should--?"
  },
  {
   "i": 75,
   "start": 255.88,
   "end": 257.06,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Piccolo",
   "text": "DOOODGE!!"
  },
  {
   "i": 76,
   "start": 256.38,
   "end": 257.06,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Krillin",
   "text": "Hah!"
  },
  {
   "i": 77,
   "start": 258.78,
   "end": 260.18,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "DAKKA! DAKKA! DAKKA! DAKKA! DA--!"
  },
  {
   "i": 78,
   "start": 262.3,
   "end": 262.98,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "DAKKA! DAKKA--"
  },
  {
   "i": 79,
   "start": 262.98,
   "end": 263.48,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "DAKKA DAKKA--AH!"
  },
  {
   "i": 80,
   "start": 263.98,
   "end": 266.82,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "Ah... hurrgh!"
  },
  {
   "i": 81,
   "start": 263.98,
   "end": 266.82,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Freeza",
   "text": "So, are we done playing children's games, Vegeta?"
  },
  {
   "i": 82,
   "start": 266.82,
   "end": 268.74,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Freeza",
   "text": "Or do I have to *tickle* you?"
  },
  {
   "i": 83,
   "start": 268.74,
   "end": 271.64,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "St-stop... stop, stop..."
  },
  {
   "i": 84,
   "start": 268.74,
   "end": 271.64,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Freeza",
   "text": "Eh? Eh~? Coochie coo, coochie coochie coochie coo?"
  },
  {
   "i": 85,
   "start": 271.64,
   "end": 273.76,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "STOP IT OR I'M GONNA BLOW YOU UP!!"
  },
  {
   "i": 86,
   "start": 275.64,
   "end": 279.14,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "We'll see how you stand up to everything I've got!"
  },
  {
   "i": 87,
   "start": 279.58,
   "end": 284.0,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "Take... my Super... Saiyan... WRAAATH!!"
  },
  {
   "i": 88,
   "start": 287.5,
   "end": 292.72,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Freeza",
   "text": "'Oh, and I should probably send the Ginyu's families something... Perhaps some wine, a gift basket...'"
  },
  {
   "i": 89,
   "start": 293.86,
   "end": 294.48,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "AUGH!"
  },
  {
   "i": 90,
   "start": 296.7,
   "end": 298.78,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Freeza",
   "text": "'...or maybe gift baskets *with* wine.'"
  },
  {
   "i": 91,
   "start": 299.28,
   "end": 304.14,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "Wh-what...? How-aah...? How is tha--...? Oh God..."
  },
  {
   "i": 92,
   "start": 304.149,
   "end": 308.82,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Freeza",
   "text": "See? It's like I told you, Vegeta... like a *bitch*!"
  },
  {
   "i": 93,
   "start": 308.829,
   "end": 309.9,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "Shut up!!"
  },
  {
   "i": 94,
   "start": 309.9,
   "end": 313.0,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Freeza",
   "text": "Oh my *God*, you actually are crying!"
  },
  {
   "i": 95,
   "start": 313.0,
   "end": 315.28,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "I'm not crying!! Not!!"
  },
  {
   "i": 96,
   "start": 315.28,
   "end": 321.78,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Freeza",
   "text": "Honestly, now I just feel bad. Usually, I just blow up whatever's in my way, but with you, I've gotten kind of attached."
  },
  {
   "i": 97,
   "start": 319.06,
   "end": 321.78,
   "kind": "direction",
   "speaker": null,
   "text": "Vegeta whimpers in fear"
  },
  {
   "i": 98,
   "start": 321.78,
   "end": 324.2,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Freeza",
   "text": "It's sort of like putting down Old Space Yeller."
  },
  {
   "i": 99,
   "start": 324.2,
   "end": 325.98,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Krillin",
   "text": "How is that a thing??"
  },
  {
   "i": 100,
   "start": 325.99,
   "end": 331.19,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Freeza",
   "text": "It's sad, really... but before we part ways, Vegeta, let me tell you a *tale*."
  },
  {
   "i": 101,
   "start": 331.19,
   "end": 332.28,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "AAAAH!"
  },
  {
   "i": 102,
   "start": 332.28,
   "end": 333.06,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Freeza",
   "text": "The End."
  },
  {
   "i": 103,
   "start": 333.26,
   "end": 334.9,
   "kind": "sfx",
   "speaker": null,
   "text": "SPLASH"
  },
  {
   "i": 104,
   "start": 343.93,
   "end": 349.449,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Freeza",
   "text": "See that, Vegeta? Now, for my next trick, I'm going to make an asshole disappear!"
  },
  {
   "i": 105,
   "start": 349.449,
   "end": 353.269,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Orpheus",
   "text": "Wagwan, brethren Vegeta? Me be ya spirit animal."
  },
  {
   "i": 106,
   "start": 353.269,
   "end": 357.7,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Orpheus",
   "text": "And me here tell you how to mash up that bumbaclot Freeza. All ya gotta do is--"
  },
  {
   "i": 107,
