   "text": "...Who--"
  },
  {
   "i": 191,
   "start": 470.28,
   "end": 473.42,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Goku",
   "text": "Hey guys, how's it going? Piccolo? When did you come back?"
  },
  {
   "i": 192,
   "start": 473.42,
   "end": 474.94,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Piccolo",
   "text": "Uh... Dragon Balls."
  },
  {
   "i": 193,
   "start": 474.94,
   "end": 478.2,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Goku",
   "text": "Oh, neat! Hey, Krillin! That armor looks funny on ya!"
  },
  {
   "i": 194,
   "start": 478.2,
   "end": 479.04,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Gohan",
   "text": "Hey, Dad!"
  },
  {
   "i": 195,
   "start": 479.04,
   "end": 479.54,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Goku",
   "text": "Hey."
  },
  {
   "i": 196,
   "start": 479.54,
   "end": 481.16,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Goku",
   "text": "So are you that Freezer guy?"
  },
  {
   "i": 197,
   "start": 481.74,
   "end": 484.0,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Freeza",
   "text": "...I am *Lord* Freeza, yes."
  },
  {
   "i": 198,
   "start": 484.0,
   "end": 486.4,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Goku",
   "text": "Awesome! I'mma deck you in the schnoz!"
  },
  {
   "i": 199,
   "start": 487.26,
   "end": 488.4,
   "kind": "sfx",
   "speaker": null,
   "text": "THUD"
  },
  {
   "i": 200,
   "start": 487.26,
   "end": 488.4,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "Owww..."
  },
  {
   "i": 201,
   "start": 488.4,
   "end": 492.78,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Freeza",
   "text": "I'm sorry, that's a new one, er... who, are you, exactly?"
  },
  {
   "i": 202,
   "start": 492.78,
   "end": 497.54,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Goku",
   "text": "I'm Goku! I'm insane... from Earth!"
  },
  {
   "i": 203,
   "start": 497.54,
   "end": 499.12,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Freeza",
   "text": "..."
  },
  {
   "i": 204,
   "start": 499.12,
   "end": 501.22,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "He means Saiyan..."
  },
  {
   "i": 205,
   "start": 501.22,
   "end": 504.999,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Freeza",
   "text": "Uh, between you and the Namekian, I think I've lost my touch at genocide!"
  },
  {
   "i": 206,
   "start": 504.999,
   "end": 508.359,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Goku",
   "text": "What's wrong, Vegeta? Did Freezer do this to you?"
  },
  {
   "i": 207,
   "start": 508.36,
   "end": 513.6,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Freeza",
   "text": "Oh look, he's all concerned. I'm impressed, Vegeta; you managed to make a friend."
  },
  {
   "i": 208,
   "start": 513.6,
   "end": 516.06,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "Hate you... hate you both..."
  },
  {
   "i": 209,
   "start": 516.06,
   "end": 519.44,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Freeza",
   "text": "Unfortunately, Vegeta and I were having a disagreement."
  },
  {
   "i": 210,
   "start": 519.44,
   "end": 523.2,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Freeza",
   "text": "He wanted himself to live, and well... I didn't."
  },
  {
   "i": 211,
   "start": 523.2,
   "end": 524.66,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Goku",
   "text": "Why do you wanna die?"
  },
  {
   "i": 212,
   "start": 524.66,
   "end": 527.94,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Freeza",
   "text": "Wha--... no, I, I-I mea--I meant I want *him* to die--"
  },
  {
   "i": 213,
   "start": 527.94,
   "end": 529.06,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Goku",
   "text": "Is it 'cause you look weird?"
  },
  {
   "i": 214,
   "start": 529.68,
   "end": 530.24,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Freeza",
   "text": "...WHAT?"
  },
  {
   "i": 215,
   "start": 530.24,
   "end": 534.68,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Goku",
   "text": "Well, you know you got that big head, those weird lips and that tail..."
  },
  {
   "i": 216,
   "start": 533.42,
   "end": 534.68,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Freeza",
   "text": "Eeeegh!"
  },
  {
   "i": 217,
   "start": 536.66,
   "end": 538.32,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Goku",
   "text": "...and you don't have ears..."
  },
  {
   "i": 218,
   "start": 538.32,
   "end": 539.54,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Freeza",
   "text": "OK, *no*!"
  },
  {
   "i": 219,
   "start": 545.18,
   "end": 548.08,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Goku",
   "text": "...and to top it all off, you're really kind of a jerk."
  },
  {
   "i": 220,
   "start": 548.08,
   "end": 549.88,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Freeza",
   "text": "And apparently, this is now happening."
  },
  {
   "i": 221,
   "start": 549.88,
   "end": 551.48,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Freeza",
   "text": "Vegeta! Explain!"
  },
  {
   "i": 222,
   "start": 551.48,
   "end": 555.04,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "Ha ha ha ha ha ha ha ha ha ha..."
